@startuml fig-2-9-communication-analyse
' Figure 2.9 — Communication diagram for POST /analyze
!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

object ":ServiceWorker" as SW
object ":AnalyzeRouter" as Router
object ":VirusTotalClient" as VTC
object ":UrlFeatureExtractor" as UFE
object ":HeuristicsEngine" as HE
object ":ShapAnalysis" as SHAP
object ":RiskFusion" as RF
object ":ExplainerFormatter" as EF
object ":ScanRepository" as Repo

SW --> Router : 1: analyze(url, signals)
Router --> VTC : 1.1: get_domain_info(domain)
Router --> HE : 1.2: evaluate(network, permission)
Router --> UFE : 1.3: extract_url_features(url, vt)
Router --> SHAP : 1.4: explain_prediction(vector)
SHAP --> RF : 1.4.1: fuse(p_url, signals)
SHAP --> EF : 1.4.2 *[each attribution]: format_reason(name, value, impact)
Router --> Repo : 1.5: persist(scan)

note bottom of RF
  1.4.1 returns browser-signal
  attributions already expressed
  in log-odds, so 1.4.2 can treat
  them identically to SHAP values.
end note
@enduml
